# The hero's naked body (reports/content/2026-11-hero-body/naked-body.md): the original HUM_BODY_NAKED0 he starts
# in and a test content root that replaces it, judged side by side from the same cameras. A new game, no armour.
# Noon at the market: still shots around the hero, the neck seam close up, a walk from the side, a run from behind, cheering with raised fists from the front,
# a one-handed attack from the side and from behind (raised arms, a twisted torso). The legs close from behind -
# standing, walking and running - judge the knees (reports/engine/2026-11-modern-skeleton, «Ноги»).
